      <title>AI服务器厂商戴尔、慧与科技、联想和超微电脑涨价最高达45%</title>
      <link>https://111.230.153.15/news/?batch=smart-20261123-104701&amp;cat=tech&amp;event=evt_003273e10aeb</link>
